me anything?","source_cn":"……刚才那混蛋说的话，你没什么要问的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED071CE9E0EBF456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111020007:1":{"text":"I don't care about your past; I mean it.","source_cn":"我说过，你的过去，我不关心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECC7921848335789","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111020008:1":{"text":"What happened between you and Wyatt, how he met his end, and why you're out for vengeance—it's none of my concern.","source_cn":"你和怀亚特之间发生了什么，他怎么牺牲，你为什么寻仇，和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x595685C0494835BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111020009:1":{"text":"We can continue to travel together as long as you still want to beat Ferranc.","source_cn":"但是，只要你还想彻底击溃弗兰克，我们就可以继续同路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A9314D74BE767E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111020010:1":{"text":"What about your clan members?","source_cn":"你不是为了救族人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x721CFC65A3458164","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111